nal schematic reach, not observed current edges. Surface peaks may be eddies or North Pacific exchange; no cold-water property gate or historical upper-1000 m identity transfer. Westward Alaskan Stream and Bering-side North Slope Current remain separate. Local monthly-mean component spans, not flow-normal widths, whole-current dimensions or a seasonal footprint.\",\r\n  \"layer\": \"Satellite-derived near-surface product with nominal 15 m coordinate; not a direct 15 m instrument section or depth-resolved velocity.\",\r\n  \"time_convention\": \"72 nominal five-day 2013 archive samples, with four six-day gaps, January 1 through December 26. One year, not climatology or adequate evidence for annual extrema.\",\r\n  \"monthly_width_is_mean_of_instantaneous_widths\": false,\r\n  \"is_climatology\": false,\r\n  \"current_association_verified\": false,\r\n  \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n  \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n  \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n  \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n  \"chart_playback_eligible\": true,\r\n  \"whole_current_length_km\": null,\r\n  \"whole_current_width_km\": null,\r\n  \"annual_length_range_km\": null,\r\n  \"annual_width_range_km\": null,\r\n  \"measurement_uncertainty_interval_km\": null,\r\n  \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n  \"source_inventory_file\": \"research/basin-surface-section-inventory.json\",\r\n  \"source_inventory_sha256\": \"01d714f3b79614019c934b3cb73724dc24f877a0d8214f442d02a558c34c7104\",\r\n  \"config_file\": \"research/basin-surface-section-input.json\",\r\n  \"config_sha256\": \"24b45e117b2560fdedcdb2dc9963e856a183fe6b3825b869a62d54f91f599c01\",\r\n  \"scope_audit_file\": \"research/aleutian-alaskan-stream-naming-scope-audit.json\",\r\n  \"scope_audit_sha256\": \"cba7e2ef24c3503ce5f9df057f84721001633db4c9c4d3095a0e9acac052c1fa\",\r\n  \"protocol_file\": \"plans/basin-surface-section-width-protocol-v1.md\",\r\n  \"protocol_sha256\": \"deab556d97430d06bffff25b7a6e1469855785a5b